"记录整台 Mac 活动接口的字节增量，不记录 IP、域名、端口或数据内容，也不归因到具体 App。VPN、虚拟网卡或接口转发可能让同一流量被重复计算；睡眠、暂停及 App 未运行期间不补算。" = "Records byte deltas across active interfaces on this Mac. IP addresses, domains, ports, content, and per-app attribution are not stored. VPNs, virtual interfaces, or interface forwarding may count the same traffic more than once. Traffic during sleep, pauses, or while the app is not running is not inferred.";

